# PRESENTER_KEY is the presenter secret: whoever holds it can run your
# questions. Use a long random value, e.g. the output of
#   openssl rand -hex 24
# and keep a copy; you open your deck once with ?presenter=<key>.
#
# Deploy to Cloudflare button: this file is how the setup page knows to ask
# for PRESENTER_KEY. Paste your random value there.
# Command line deploy: bunx wrangler secret put PRESENTER_KEY
# Local `wrangler dev`: copy this file to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in
# a value; a short one such as "dev" is fine on your own machine.
PRESENTER_KEY=
